---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User requests document conversion]
    B --> C[AI assistant or external website prepares request]
    C --> D[Send request through MCP or conversion API]
    D --> E[Retrieve template]
    E --> F{Template available?}

    F -- No --> G[Return template error]
    G --> H([End])

    F -- Yes --> I[Validate Markdown]
    I --> J{Document valid?}

    J -- No --> K[Return validation errors]
    K --> H

    J -- Yes --> L[Generate and compile PDF]
    L --> M{Compilation successful?}

    M -- No --> N[Return compilation error]
    N --> H

    M -- Yes --> O[Return PDF to requester]
    O --> P([End])